{"id":"db52121d11e13a81","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-shannon.md","title":"Boole–Shannon expansion","display":"thm-shannon — Boole–Shannon expansion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-shannon","aliases":["27-thm-shannon"],"display":"thm-shannon — Boole–Shannon expansion","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-restrict]]","[[27-df-boolop]]"],"local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-shannon"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-shannon</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shannon — Boole–Shannon expansion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9964b0194f4fb6e6\" href=\"?note=9964b0194f4fb6e6\" title=\"27-df-restrict\">27-df-restrict</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_{i\\leftarrow0},f_{i\\leftarrow1}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f_{i\\leftarrow0},f_{i\\leftarrow1}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9964b0194f4fb6e6\" href=\"?note=9964b0194f4fb6e6\" title=\"27-df-restrict\">27-df-restrict</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(y_1,\\ldots,y_{i-1},b,y_i,\\ldots,y_{n-1})=(b\\wedge f_{i\\leftarrow1}(y))\\vee((1-b)\\wedge f_{i\\leftarrow0}(y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(y_1,\\ldots,y_{i-1},b,y_i,\\ldots,y_{n-1})=(b\\wedge f_{i\\leftarrow1}(y))\\vee((1-b)\\wedge f_{i\\leftarrow0}(y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two cofactors are evaluated on the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n-1)\">\\((n-1)\\)</span>-tuple obtained after deleting coordinate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-restrict","status":"resolved","id":"9964b0194f4fb6e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-restrict]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ and $i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$ (see [[27-df-boolfunc]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-restrict","status":"resolved","id":"9964b0194f4fb6e6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f_{i\\leftarrow0},f_{i\\leftarrow1}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B$ (see [[27-df-restrict]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f_{i\\leftarrow0},f_{i\\leftarrow1}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"f(y_1,\\ldots,y_{i-1},b,y_i,\\ldots,y_{n-1})=(b\\wedge f_{i\\leftarrow1}(y))\\vee((1-b)\\wedge f_{i\\leftarrow0}(y))","display":true},{"tex":"(n-1)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":899,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-557","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-shannon|thm-shannon — Boole–Shannon expansion]]"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817","9964b0194f4fb6e6","11de8465f2282555"]}